    "STL-203 -> 11:00-12:30 (overlapped the hold); STL-204 -> 12:30-13:00, pauses for the blackout, 14:00-14:30;",
    "STL-205 -> 12:30-14:00 (the later of STL-203 at 12:30 and the hold at 11:00); STL-206 -> Wed 14:30-16:00, pauses overnight, Thu 08:00-08:30.",
    "STL-203 claims the FX slot before STL-204 because ready tasks are placed in original start order.",
    "Expected changes: STL-203 start +120, end +120 min (channel busy with STL-201);",
    "STL-204 start +90, end +150 min (channel busy with STL-203, blackout: CLS settlement cut-off);",
    "STL-205 start +120, end +120 min (waited for STL-203);",
    "STL-206 start +30, end +990 min (waited for STL-204, outside operating hours)."
